{# *Try on one month* (0640), on top of the Events tab: the latest month of the classify
   plan sorted first, then its photos in the grid, ↶ Undo and *Sort the rest*. Shown only
   while no run moved files of the plan. #}
<div id="trialBox" class="writes" hidden>
  <p id="trialSaid" class="muted" role="status"></p>
  <ul id="trialFolders"></ul>
  <p>
    <button type="button" id="trialTry" class="writes" title="{{ _('Sort only this month, journaled, then see its photos in their new folders; undo puts them back') }}"></button>
    <button type="button" id="trialUndo" class="plain writes" hidden>↶ {{ _("Undo") }}</button>
    <button type="button" id="trialRest" class="writes" hidden></button>
  </p>
</div>
